WEBVTT

00:50:29.662 --> 00:50:32.242
because I felt like this
is interfering with my grief,

00:50:32.266 --> 00:50:35.051
and then I realized,
"Oh, no -- this is my grief.

00:50:35.075 --> 00:50:39.469
My grief is manifesting itself
as ferocious, blind rage right now."

00:50:39.493 --> 00:50:43.666
CA: If you believe that these
external things are coming to you

00:50:43.690 --> 00:50:44.987
and you don't control them,

00:50:45.011 --> 00:50:48.503
then yes, it's like
the universe, how dare you.

00:50:48.527 --> 00:50:53.508
How dare you take down this person
in the way that you did?

00:50:53.532 --> 00:50:57.004
That is disgusting.

00:50:57.028 --> 00:51:00.498
That is deeply, profoundly unfair.